    <TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border: black 1.5pt solid"><P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 2pt 0pt; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B>Important
                                            Notice Regarding the Availability of Proxy Materials for the Shareholders&rsquo; Meeting
                                            </B></FONT></P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B>to
    Be Held Virtually on December 26, 2023 at 12:00 p.m. (ET) virtually via the Internet at <U>www.virtualshareholdermeeting.com/INVO
    2023.</U> </B></FONT></P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 3pt 0pt; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
