voting or dispositive power with respect to the securities. Unless otherwise indicated below, to our knowledge, all persons listed below
have sole voting and dispositive power with respect to their shares of our common stock, except to the extent authority is shared by
spouses under applicable law. Unless otherwise noted, the address of all of the individuals and entities named below is c/o INVO Bioscience,
Inc., 5582 Broadcast Court Sarasota, Florida, 34240.</FONT></P>

