following Summary Compensation Table sets forth, for the years indicated, all cash compensation paid, distributed or accrued for services,
including salary and bonus amounts, rendered in all capacities by the Company&rsquo;s &ldquo;named executive officers&rdquo; for SEC
reporting purposes. All share amounts and exercise prices set forth in this section (Executive Compensation) have been retroactively
adjusted to give effect to the Company&rsquo;s 1-20 reverse stock split effectuated on July 28, 2023.</FONT></P>

